    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενδρο-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing trees,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγξ</span> Theodor. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.621b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρουρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					328i17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					12
