				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτηρ δενδροφόρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					1.614
				</span></i>
			 (Tomi, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); freq. in Lat. Inscrr., cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mens.</u>
				4.59
			</span></i>.</div>
